(4493855, 648028, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Light seems a little flat with the grey snow - could be the camera underexposing due to all of the white in the pic?</td>', 'Great composition. Light seems a little flat with the grey snow - could be the camera underexposing due to all of the white in the pic?', '2008-02-18 05:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
