(4494120, 647613, 50034, '<td valign="top">Been There!  Done That!  :)  Dude!  You just brought back some memories!  <i>(Shivvvvvvvvvver!)</i>  :}<br/> <br/>I once heard Gil on the original CSI say, "In high school I was the ghost!"  That was me, too!  People see through you!  You fade into the walls!  You float along...just trying not to make waves!  Even though I one of two co-valedictorians graduating with a 4.0, I could have wished for less GPA and more real connection.<br/> <br/>Like the old saying goes, <i>"''A'' students don''t always make the greatest success in Life!  ''C'' students tend to be more well-rounded and functional in a Social World!"</i> <br/> <br/>Great leading lines!  However, I believe that a tighter crop &amp; placement a little more off-center would have served you better in the score department.  :/</td>', 'Been There!  Done That!  :)  Dude!  You just brought back some memories!  (Shivvvvvvvvvver!)  :} I once heard Gil on the original CSI say, "In high school I was the ghost!"  That was me, too!  People see through you!  You fade into the walls!  You float along...just trying not to make waves!  Even though I one of two co-valedictorians graduating with a 4.0, I could have wished for less GPA and more real connection. Like the old saying goes, "''A'' students don''t always make the greatest success in Life!  ''C'' students tend to be more well-rounded and functional in a Social World!"  Great leading lines!  However, I believe that a tighter crop & placement a little more off-center would have served you better in the score department.  :/', '2008-02-18 08:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
