(4507144, 647521, 85886, '<td valign="top">Oh wait, is this one of those funny, insightful brown ribbon attempts.  Hang on, let me just get really high.  Ok...I''m ready.<br/> <br/>The yin-yang imagery is symbolic of your turbulent life with its ups and downs, hence the story of your life.  The misunderstanding is you caught between these two cyclical forces.<br/> <br/>Oh no..maybe this is Leroy arisen from the ashes, and this is actually a high key shot of the top half of a naked woman in profile on a dark background with a very low bust and a very long neck.  I hope that doesn''t offend your model.<br/> <br/>I must say, what a fabulous showcase of both your artistic and photographic talent this image is.</td>', 'Oh wait, is this one of those funny, insightful brown ribbon attempts.  Hang on, let me just get really high.  Ok...I''m ready. The yin-yang imagery is symbolic of your turbulent life with its ups and downs, hence the story of your life.  The misunderstanding is you caught between these two cyclical forces. Oh no..maybe this is Leroy arisen from the ashes, and this is actually a high key shot of the top half of a naked woman in profile on a dark background with a very low bust and a very long neck.  I hope that doesn''t offend your model. I must say, what a fabulous showcase of both your artistic and photographic talent this image is.', '2008-02-22 11:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507156, 647903, 85886, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2008-02-22 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507166, 647794, 83785, '<td valign="top">Hope that''s a two ronnies inspired scene, excellent, gets extra points from me for that, lol!</td>', 'Hope that''s a two ronnies inspired scene, excellent, gets extra points from me for that, lol!', '2008-02-22 11:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507171, 648066, 85886, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!  What''s not to like about this shot?  Everything is amazing to this pair of eyes - the lighting especially, but the interpretation and execution screams 10 to me.  This was the first image presented to me on voting so I''ve no idea what the rest of the field looks like but this has to be a ribboner, nay even blue.  Well done.<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Ok..i''m back...this is easily the blue by a MILE... :)</td>', 'Outstanding!  What''s not to like about this shot?  Everything is amazing to this pair of eyes - the lighting especially, but the interpretation and execution screams 10 to me.  This was the first image presented to me on voting so I''ve no idea what the rest of the field looks like but this has to be a ribboner, nay even blue.  Well done. EDIT:  Ok..i''m back...this is easily the blue by a MILE... :)', '2008-02-22 11:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507173, 647799, 85886, '<td valign="top">Whoever''s other half they are is a lucky lucky person :)  Nice take on the challenge and nicely executed.  Mucho amusement.  My 2nd fave of the challenge and would be a ribbon in my world - 9.</td>', 'Whoever''s other half they are is a lucky lucky person :)  Nice take on the challenge and nicely executed.  Mucho amusement.  My 2nd fave of the challenge and would be a ribbon in my world - 9.', '2008-02-22 11:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
