(4507252, 648066, 15291, '<td valign="top">I kept coming back to this image &amp; each time I got the feeling that something was missing. Don''t get me wrong I think this is a great image and scored it as such. After the ninth time coming back to it, it hit me :), her hand seems to be coming forward. Catching a bit of motion in the pan may have but this over the top I scored it an 8</td>', 'I kept coming back to this image & each time I got the feeling that something was missing. Don''t get me wrong I think this is a great image and scored it as such. After the ninth time coming back to it, it hit me :), her hand seems to be coming forward. Catching a bit of motion in the pan may have but this over the top I scored it an 8', '2008-02-22 12:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4507267, 648053, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well done I like the clash here toast &amp; egg. I also like color scheme works real well. Nice image.</td>', 'Well done I like the clash here toast & egg. I also like color scheme works real well. Nice image.', '2008-02-22 12:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
