(4508609, 647903, 83313, '<td valign="top">The picture is only okay, I''m afraid. There''s some visible motion blur on her hands and the comp is not great. The humor and the idea are wonderful, though.</td>', 'The picture is only okay, I''m afraid. There''s some visible motion blur on her hands and the comp is not great. The humor and the idea are wonderful, though.', '2008-02-22 21:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508615, 647138, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seriously oversharpened. I''m not getting what the misunderstanding is, so I suppose that means I am misunderstanding it, which means I DID understand it after all. (This challenge is SOOO confusing!)</td>', 'Seriously oversharpened. I''m not getting what the misunderstanding is, so I suppose that means I am misunderstanding it, which means I DID understand it after all. (This challenge is SOOO confusing!)', '2008-02-22 22:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508619, 647962, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not something I see everyday. Perhaps a tighter crop would show the emotion on their faces more, and I find it a little too centered, but it''s still a good image.</td>', 'Not something I see everyday. Perhaps a tighter crop would show the emotion on their faces more, and I find it a little too centered, but it''s still a good image.', '2008-02-22 22:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508625, 647324, 83313, '<td valign="top">An excellent expression of a sentiment. The graininess at the top is the only thing I have any fuss with.</td>', 'An excellent expression of a sentiment. The graininess at the top is the only thing I have any fuss with.', '2008-02-22 22:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508630, 647942, 83313, '<td valign="top">From the scratch on his chin, it looks like he''s already been down at least once already! I think it would have been much better if you had not cropped out part of his back and the bottom of the sled.</td>', 'From the scratch on his chin, it looks like he''s already been down at least once already! I think it would have been much better if you had not cropped out part of his back and the bottom of the sled.', '2008-02-22 22:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4508632, 647493, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice visual pun.</td>', 'Nice visual pun.', '2008-02-22 22:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
