(4509711, 647568, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take. The tones are not working for me, though. The grain adds interest, but the darker color in the lower left takes the thought of High Key away as the detail disappears.</td>', 'This is an interesting take. The tones are not working for me, though. The grain adds interest, but the darker color in the lower left takes the thought of High Key away as the detail disappears.', '2008-02-23 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509715, 648066, 63244, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color and what a great composition. Love how everything leans from the upper left to the lower right. (Darling idea, too!)  Your lighting is very good.  I wish that the pan were not cut off.  This is a great photo/title combo.  Well done~!</td>', 'Fantastic color and what a great composition. Love how everything leans from the upper left to the lower right. (Darling idea, too!)  Your lighting is very good.  I wish that the pan were not cut off.  This is a great photo/title combo.  Well done~!', '2008-02-23 11:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509721, 646738, 63244, '<td valign="top">Darling little ferret.  Wish there were just a touch more detail. Overall a good idea, but perhaps use some solid paper and boxes here and there.  The total picture has a lot going on and it''s hard to focus on just one idea...which to me would be the little ferret.  Perhaps even cropping the entire right half of the photograph and touch off of the bottom would give you the idea, but much more focus on the star. :)</td>', 'Darling little ferret.  Wish there were just a touch more detail. Overall a good idea, but perhaps use some solid paper and boxes here and there.  The total picture has a lot going on and it''s hard to focus on just one idea...which to me would be the little ferret.  Perhaps even cropping the entire right half of the photograph and touch off of the bottom would give you the idea, but much more focus on the star. :)', '2008-02-23 11:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
