(4513908, 647344, 81669, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your nice comments! My highest scoring entry yet. In retrospect, I think I could''ve done a little better with the execution of this one. Shouldn''t have waited until the "last minute" to try to put it together. But, thanks again. 19th is a really major step in the right direction for me; and I''m so glad several of you got a laugh out of this one. Peace, Love, and Much Happiness to You! -- "Old Coyote"<br/> <br/>(And by the way, I think the USA would do far better to embrace our brothers and sisters from around the world than to try to build fences to keep everyone out. It''s time to Make Peace by building bridges! Let''s hope there''s a new day dawning!!)</td>', 'Thanks for all your nice comments! My highest scoring entry yet. In retrospect, I think I could''ve done a little better with the execution of this one. Shouldn''t have waited until the "last minute" to try to put it together. But, thanks again. 19th is a really major step in the right direction for me; and I''m so glad several of you got a laugh out of this one. Peace, Love, and Much Happiness to You! -- "Old Coyote" (And by the way, I think the USA would do far better to embrace our brothers and sisters from around the world than to try to build fences to keep everyone out. It''s time to Make Peace by building bridges! Let''s hope there''s a new day dawning!!)', '2008-02-25 06:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
