(4514470, 647613, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. . . I LIKE this one!!  Great job!  I bet the band loved it.  Don''t you love it when you get a great shot on a week when one fits perfectly with a challenge?   I wish is wasn''t underrated tho. . .it deserves to have scored and placed much higher!</td>', 'Ooooh. . . I LIKE this one!!  Great job!  I bet the band loved it.  Don''t you love it when you get a great shot on a week when one fits perfectly with a challenge?   I wish is wasn''t underrated tho. . .it deserves to have scored and placed much higher!', '2008-02-25 10:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4514661, 647167, 53710, '<td valign="top">Wow!, I''m pretty impressed with my first try. In brainstorming for this challenge I knew I wanted to do something different, the idea came easy, however going into a public bathroom on Valentines Day in a popular hotel didn''t make things easy. I finally got about a 2 minute window in which the bathroom was empty so it had to be fast, imagine the looks if people walked in and there I am with a camera pointed under the stalls.</td>', 'Wow!, I''m pretty impressed with my first try. In brainstorming for this challenge I knew I wanted to do something different, the idea came easy, however going into a public bathroom on Valentines Day in a popular hotel didn''t make things easy. I finally got about a 2 minute window in which the bathroom was empty so it had to be fast, imagine the looks if people walked in and there I am with a camera pointed under the stalls.', '2008-02-25 10:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4514705, 648053, 67697, '<td valign="top">It is funny!  Beautiful layout.  I love the patterns of the placemat and napkin holder.  Great lighting too.  Quite a creative set-up!</td>', 'It is funny!  Beautiful layout.  I love the patterns of the placemat and napkin holder.  Great lighting too.  Quite a creative set-up!', '2008-02-25 10:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
