(4515019, 647914, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a model! How can you go wrong?! Oh, by messing up the download. Too bad about the DQ, but as far as I''m concerned, it doesn''t matter. You still have a very fun shot of Svetlana. Great expression. I like what you have done with the eyes -- real surprise there.</td>', 'What a model! How can you go wrong?! Oh, by messing up the download. Too bad about the DQ, but as far as I''m concerned, it doesn''t matter. You still have a very fun shot of Svetlana. Great expression. I like what you have done with the eyes -- real surprise there.', '2008-02-25 12:38:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4515046, 647995, 66384, '<td valign="top">Dave, I never guessed this was yours. I like the humor and expression on the model. The problem, and the reason I didn''t give it a very high score, is the lighting. While the flash will help you capture a fun moment, it won''t usually produce a high quality image. But, hey, someone chose it as a favorite, so you never can tell. If you aren''t ready to invest in an expensive flash attachment you might consider <a href="//store.garyfonginc.com/puf-01.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this diffuser</a>. It''s not the final answer, but it definitely helps.</td>', 'Dave, I never guessed this was yours. I like the humor and expression on the model. The problem, and the reason I didn''t give it a very high score, is the lighting. While the flash will help you capture a fun moment, it won''t usually produce a high quality image. But, hey, someone chose it as a favorite, so you never can tell. If you aren''t ready to invest in an expensive flash attachment you might consider this diffuser. It''s not the final answer, but it definitely helps.', '2008-02-25 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4515067, 648091, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. I love the color and composition. I think your interpretation of the challenge was valid, and I have nominated this for an OOBIE.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. I love the color and composition. I think your interpretation of the challenge was valid, and I have nominated this for an OOBIE.', '2008-02-25 13:01:29.000000', NULL, 0),
