(4515201, 647689, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''ve been Yanko''d! Hehe... this one certainly stood out from the pack. Very clean, graphic and a good concept. How can you go wrong? The smoothness looked like noise reduction gone wild, but it makes sense if you painted with light. Still, I thought at best this would score a 6.5... ;-P</td>', 'I''ve been Yanko''d! Hehe... this one certainly stood out from the pack. Very clean, graphic and a good concept. How can you go wrong? The smoothness looked like noise reduction gone wild, but it makes sense if you painted with light. Still, I thought at best this would score a 6.5... ;-P', '2008-02-25 13:42:49.000000', NULL, 0),
