(4540222, 648074, 23098, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> You''ve captured photographically an application from Murphy''s Lawbook that I was telling my kids just last week: whatever screwdriver is most nearby will be the one you don''t happen to need. <br/> <br/>I love the actual composition of this -- the arrangement of everything is perfect. And the high contrast and harsh shadows really drive (no pun intended) the point home. Nice job! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks bvy.  I was playing around with HDR for this one.  Haven''t quite gotten the hang of that yet though, so just used the contrasty version instead.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: You''ve captured photographically an application from Murphy''s Lawbook that I was telling my kids just last week: whatever screwdriver is most nearby will be the one you don''t happen to need.  I love the actual composition of this -- the arrangement of everything is perfect. And the high contrast and harsh shadows really drive (no pun intended) the point home. Nice job!  Thanks bvy.  I was playing around with HDR for this one.  Haven''t quite gotten the hang of that yet though, so just used the contrasty version instead.', '2008-03-05 10:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
